---
import ResourcePageLayout from "../../../layouts/ResourcePageLayout.astro";
import { localizedHref } from "../../../i18n/routes";
---

<ResourcePageLayout
  title="Value 4 Value"
  description="What is Value4Value? A new model for supporting content directly with bitcoin."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="content-section">
    <p>
      Value for Value is the idea that you offer value out into the market, and
      people can then choose for themselves to contribute if they feel they benefit
      from the material someone offers. It's entirely voluntary, and current
      estimates suggest only 4–5% choose to contribute. Many have grown used to
      being able to access podcasts, videos, music, articles, blog posts, and so on
      "for free" — but the price you typically pay is your attention, in the form
      of ads, for example, and most often also giving up your data and privacy.
    </p>
    <p>
      The Value 4 Value model breaks with the previously familiar "freemium"
      models and has been warmly received by many of the people who also value
      freedom technologies such as Bitcoin and Nostr. New V4V offerings keep
      appearing, and this page links to a few examples. The best known are
      Podcasting 2.0 and Nostr.
    </p>
    <p>
      "Enogtyve.org" is another example, where there's no model for making money
      or covering costs like hosting. If you feel it provides value and want to
      contribute to the initiatives, you can send some sats to enogtyve@getalby.com
      or check out the <a href={localizedHref('/da/faellesskab/support', 'en')}>support page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="category-section">
    <h2>Examples of Value 4 Value initiatives</h2>
    <div class="info-table">
      <div class="info-row info-header">
        <span class="info-label">Type</span>
        <span class="info-value"><strong>Link</strong></span>
      </div>
      <div class="info-row">
        <span class="info-label">Podcasting 2.0</span>
        <span class="info-value">
          <a href="https://fountain.fm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">fountain.fm</a>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="info-row">
        <span class="info-label">Blog</span>
        <span class="info-value">
          <a href="https://stacker.news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">stacker.news</a>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="info-row">
        <span class="info-label">Music</span>
        <span class="info-value">
          <a href="https://wavlake.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">wavlake.com</a>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="info-row">
        <span class="info-label">Stream / Broadcast</span>
        <span class="info-value">
          <a href="https://zap.stream" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">zap.stream</a>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="info-row">
        <span class="info-label">Stream / Broadcast</span>
        <span class="info-value">
          <a href="https://tunestr.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">tunestr.io</a>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="info-row">
        <span class="info-label">Musician "The Higher Low"</span>
        <span class="info-value">
          <a href="https://www.thehigherlow.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">thehigherlow.com</a>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="category-section">
    <h2>Podcasts about Value 4 Value</h2>
    <div class="links-grid">
      <a href="https://youtu.be/PgihPtnBSek?si=YFoHQeI0JH-Ro0ik" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Kevin Rooke: V4V with Adam Curry</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://serve.podhome.fm/episodepage/djvalerieblove/the-future-of-music-bitcoin-value-for-value-and-the-higher-lows-vision" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">DJ Valerie: V4V with The Higher Low</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="more-link">
      <strong>More about Value 4 Value here:</strong>
      <a href="https://value4value.info/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Value4value.info
      </a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="category-section">
    <h2>What is Nostr?</h2>
    <div class="nostr-block">
      <img
        src="/images/logos/shaka.png"
        alt="Nostr shaka logo"
        class="nostr-logo"
      />
      <div class="nostr-text">
        <p>
          <strong>Nostr stands for "Notes and Other Stuff Transmitted Over
          Relays"</strong> and grows out of the idea of creating as simple a
          protocol as possible — one that works for anyone with internet access
          but that, unlike well-known social networks such as Twitter/X, cannot be
          censored.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="https://www.nostr.dk/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <strong>Click here to learn a bit about Nostr</strong>
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <a href="#" class="back-to-top"> ↑ Back to top </a>
</ResourcePageLayout>

<style>
  /* Content sections */
  .content-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
  }

  .content-section p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Category sections */
  .category-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
  }

  .category-section h2 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md, 1rem);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-sm, 0.5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.2);
  }

  /* Info table */
  .info-table {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.15);
  }

  .info-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.08);
  }

  .info-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .info-row:not(.info-header):hover {
    background: rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.06);
  }

  .info-header {
    background: rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.08);
  }

  .info-label {
    flex: 0 0 35%;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
  }

  .info-value {
    flex: 1;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  /* Nostr block */
  .nostr-block {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .nostr-logo {
    width: 80px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .nostr-text p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .more-link {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Links grid */
  .links-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md, 1rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .link-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.15);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .link-card:hover {
    background: rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.08);
    border-color: var(--primary);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .link-card-title {
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .link-card-arrow {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-left: 0.75rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 567px) {
    .nostr-block {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .nostr-logo {
      width: 64px;
    }

    .info-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }

    .info-label {
      flex: none;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
  }
</style>
